    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, slice, and shred your way through hordes of the undead in Cryptis, a retro-inspired boomer shooter combining modern visuals with '90s gameplay. Embrace the chaos, slaughter your enemies, and leave nothing left standing!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Slay your enemies!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421370/extras/3a251e862707b720c6375f2095436304.poster.avif?t=1745086646\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421370/extras/3a251e862707b720c6375f2095436304.webm?t=1745086646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421370/extras/3a251e862707b720c6375f2095436304.mp4?t=1745086646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight waves of monsters and utilize a diverse arsenal of weapons. Every weapon provides a different playstyle, choose whichever you prefer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Multiple unique combat arenas</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421370/extras/186e7fba26497947cfa152ba6da6c575.poster.avif?t=1745086646\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421370/extras/186e7fba26497947cfa152ba6da6c575.webm?t=1745086646\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421370/extras/186e7fba26497947cfa152ba6da6c575.mp4?t=1745086646\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in snowy woodlands, rocky deserts, and various other combat arenas with random weather conditions. </p>",
